# Project Structure

## Directory Layout
```
app/                        — Expo Router screens (file = route)
  _layout.tsx               — Root layout (splash, fonts, theme hydration)
  (tabs)/_layout.tsx        — Tab bar config (4 tabs)
  (tabs)/index.tsx          — Home — Boilerplate Explorer showcase
  (tabs)/search.tsx         — Search — categories, trending, recent
  (tabs)/notifications.tsx  — Notifications — today/earlier with unread dots
  (tabs)/settings.tsx       — Settings — grouped sections with app info

src/                        — Shared application code
  components/ui/            — Reusable UI components (ThemedText, Button, Card)
  constants/                — Design tokens (Colors, Layout)
  hooks/                    — Custom React hooks (useThemeColor)
  i18n/                     — i18next + locales (en.json, es.json)
  screens/home/             — Home screen components and mock data
  services/api.ts           — HTTP client
  services/zustand/         — State management (store, slices, types)
  types/                    — Shared types and interfaces
```

## Where to Put Things
- **New screen**: Add file in `app/` or `app/(tabs)/`
- **New component**: `src/components/ui/`
- **New hook**: `src/hooks/`
- **New state**: `src/services/zustand/slices/` + update types and index
- **New translations**: `src/i18n/locales/en.json` and `es.json`
- **New types**: `src/types/` for shared, colocate domain types with their slice
- **Screen-specific components**: `src/screens/<name>/components/`
- **Mock data**: `src/screens/<name>/mock/`

## Naming
- Screen files: lowercase (`settings.tsx`, `notifications.tsx`)
- Components: PascalCase (`ThemedText.tsx`, `Button.tsx`, `CardItem.tsx`)
- Hooks: camelCase with `use` prefix (`useThemeColor.ts`)
- Constants: PascalCase (`Colors.ts`, `Layout.ts`)
- Zustand slices: camelCase with `Slice` suffix (`appSlice.ts`)
- Mock data: PascalCase (`MockData.ts`)
